<h3 data-start=3D"3138" data-end=3D"3174" class=3D"">2.2. Explication de la=
 Structure</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3176" data-end=3D"4558">
<li data-start=3D"3176" data-end=3D"3452" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3178" data-end=3D"3452" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
178" data-end=3D"3192"><code data-start=3D"3180" data-end=3D"3190">/public/=
</code></strong> : Ce r=C3=A9pertoire contient les fichiers accessibles pub=
liquement (souvent appel=C3=A9 <code data-start=3D"3272" data-end=3D"3277">=
web</code> ou <code data-start=3D"3281" data-end=3D"3286">www</code> dans c=
ertains frameworks). C=E2=80=99est ici que se trouvent les fichiers <code d=
ata-start=3D"3353" data-end=3D"3364">index.php</code>, <code data-start=3D"=
3366" data-end=3D"3377">about.php</code>, etc. Ces fichiers font le lien en=
tre l=E2=80=99utilisateur et le reste du projet.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3453" data-end=3D"3880" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3455" data-end=3D"3526" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
455" data-end=3D"3466"><code data-start=3D"3457" data-end=3D"3464">/src/</c=
ode></strong> : Ce dossier contient tout le code m=C3=A9tier de l=E2=80=99a=
pplication.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3529" data-end=3D"3880">
<li data-start=3D"3529" data-end=3D"3627" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3531" data-end=3D"3627" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
531" data-end=3D"3549"><code data-start=3D"3533" data-end=3D"3547">/Control=
ler/</code></strong> : Les contr=C3=B4leurs, qui traitent la logique et l=
=E2=80=99interaction avec les mod=C3=A8les.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3630" data-end=3D"3777" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3632" data-end=3D"3777" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
632" data-end=3D"3645"><code data-start=3D"3634" data-end=3D"3643">/Model/<=
/code></strong> : Les mod=C3=A8les, qui contiennent la logique d=E2=80=99ac=
c=C3=A8s aux donn=C3=A9es (par exemple, la r=C3=A9cup=C3=A9ration de donn=
=C3=A9es depuis une base de donn=C3=A9es).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3780" data-end=3D"3880" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3782" data-end=3D"3880" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
782" data-end=3D"3794"><code data-start=3D"3784" data-end=3D"3792">/View/</=
code></strong> : Les vues, qui g=C3=A8rent la pr=C3=A9sentation et l=E2=80=
=99affichage des donn=C3=A9es dans le navigateur.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3881" data-end=3D"4005" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3883" data-end=3D"4005" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
883" data-end=3D"3897"><code data-start=3D"3885" data-end=3D"3895">/config/=
</code></strong> : Fichiers de configuration qui peuvent contenir des infor=
mations sur la base de donn=C3=A9es, les chemins, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4006" data-end=3D"4091" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4008" data-end=3D"4091" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
008" data-end=3D"4022"><code data-start=3D"4010" data-end=3D"4020">/assets/=
</code></strong> : Contient les fichiers statiques comme les CSS, JavaScrip=
t, images.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4092" data-end=3D"4189" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4094" data-end=3D"4189" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
094" data-end=3D"4111"><code data-start=3D"4096" data-end=3D"4109">/templat=
es/</code></strong> : Fichiers de template r=C3=A9utilisables, tels que les=
 en-t=C3=AAtes et pieds de page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4190" data-end=3D"4282" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4192" data-end=3D"4282" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
192" data-end=3D"4203"><code data-start=3D"4194" data-end=3D"4201">/var/</c=
ode></strong> : Contient des fichiers g=C3=A9n=C3=A9r=C3=A9s par l=E2=80=99=
application, comme les logs ou le cache.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4283" data-end=3D"4427" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4285" data-end=3D"4427" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
285" data-end=3D"4301"><code data-start=3D"4287" data-end=3D"4299">.gitigno=
re</code></strong> : Fichier qui d=C3=A9finit quels fichiers ou dossiers Gi=
t doit ignorer (utile pour =C3=A9viter de versionner des fichiers temporair=
es).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4428" data-end=3D"4558" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4430" data-end=3D"4558" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
430" data-end=3D"4449"><code data-start=3D"4432" data-end=3D"4447">composer=
.json</code></strong> : Fichier de configuration pour le gestionnaire de d=
=C3=A9pendances Composer, qui g=C3=A8re les biblioth=C3=A8ques tierces.</p>
</li>
</ul>
