<li data-start=3D"6761" data-end=3D"7087" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6763" data-end=3D"6854" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
763" data-end=3D"6777"><code data-start=3D"6765" data-end=3D"6775">/config/=
</code></strong> : Contient toute la configuration de l=E2=80=99application=
 (routes, services, etc.).</p>
