<li data-start=3D"6857" data-end=3D"7022" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6859" data-end=3D"7022" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
859" data-end=3D"6875"><code data-start=3D"6861" data-end=3D"6873">/package=
s/</code></strong> : Fichiers de configuration sp=C3=A9cifiques aux diff=C3=
=A9rents packages (par exemple, Doctrine pour la base de donn=C3=A9es, Twig=
 pour le moteur de templates).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7025" data-end=3D"7087" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7027" data-end=3D"7087" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
