</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7088" data-end=3D"7334" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7090" data-end=3D"7137" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
090" data-end=3D"7101"><code data-start=3D"7092" data-end=3D"7099">/src/</c=
ode></strong> : Code m=C3=A9tier de votre application.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7140" data-end=3D"7334">
<li data-start=3D"7140" data-end=3D"7179" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7142" data-end=3D"7179" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
142" data-end=3D"7160"><code data-start=3D"7144" data-end=3D"7158">/Control=
ler/</code></strong> : Les contr=C3=B4leurs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7182" data-end=3D"7334" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7184" data-end=3D"7334" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
184" data-end=3D"7198"><code data-start=3D"7186" data-end=3D"7196">/Entity/=
</code></strong> : Les entit=C3=A9s, qui sont les objets repr=C3=A9sentant =
vos donn=C3=A9es (souvent utilis=C3=A9s avec Doctrine ORM pour la gestion d=
e la base de donn=C3=A9es).</p>
