</li>
<li data-start=3D"7516" data-end=3D"7593" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7518" data-end=3D"7593" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
518" data-end=3D"7529"><code data-start=3D"7520" data-end=3D"7527">/var/</c=
ode></strong> : Fichiers temporaires g=C3=A9n=C3=A9r=C3=A9s par l=E2=80=99a=
pplication (logs, cache).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7594" data-end=3D"7673" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7596" data-end=3D"7673" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
596" data-end=3D"7610"><code data-start=3D"7598" data-end=3D"7608">/vendor/=
</code></strong> : Dossier o=C3=B9 Composer place toutes les d=C3=A9pendanc=
es install=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7674" data-end=3D"7751" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7676" data-end=3D"7751" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
676" data-end=3D"7695"><code data-start=3D"7678" data-end=3D"7693">composer=
.json</code></strong> : Configuration des d=C3=A9pendances du projet via Co=
mposer.</p>
