<h2 data-start=3D"6316" data-end=3D"6354" class=3D"">V. Variables Superglob=
ales (Avanc=C3=A9)</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6356" data-end=3D"6405" class=3D"">5.1. Qu=E2=80=99est-ce=
 qu=E2=80=99une Variable Superglobale ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6407" data-end=3D"6711" class=3D"">Les variables <strong d=
ata-start=3D"6421" data-end=3D"6438">superglobales</strong> sont des variab=
les pr=C3=A9d=C3=A9finies en PHP qui sont accessibles depuis n'importe quel=
le port=C3=A9e du script. Elles contiennent des informations provenant de l=
'environnement d'ex=C3=A9cution, telles que les variables de session, les v=
ariables de formulaire, et les informations serveur.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"6713" data-end=3D"6755" class=3D"">Exemples de Variables =
Superglobales :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"6757" data-end=3D"7104">
<li data-start=3D"6757" data-end=3D"6853" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6759" data-end=3D"6853" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
759" data-end=3D"6770"><code data-start=3D"6761" data-end=3D"6768">$_GET</c=
ode></strong> : Contient les donn=C3=A9es envoy=C3=A9es via la m=C3=A9thode=
 HTTP GET (par exemple, dans l'URL).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6854" data-end=3D"6960" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6856" data-end=3D"6960" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
856" data-end=3D"6868"><code data-start=3D"6858" data-end=3D"6866">$_POST</=
code></strong> : Contient les donn=C3=A9es envoy=C3=A9es via la m=C3=A9thod=
e HTTP POST (par exemple, dans un formulaire).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6961" data-end=3D"7024" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6963" data-end=3D"7024" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
963" data-end=3D"6978"><code data-start=3D"6965" data-end=3D"6976">$_SESSIO=
N</code></strong> : Permet de stocker des variables de session.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7025" data-end=3D"7101" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7027" data-end=3D"7101" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
027" data-end=3D"7041"><code data-start=3D"7029" data-end=3D"7039">$_SERVER=
</code></strong> : Contient des informations sur l'environnement du serveur=
.</p>
</li>
</ul>
