<h3 data-start=3D"2148" data-end=3D"2178" class=3D"">1.3. R=C3=A8gles de D=
=C3=A9claration</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2180" data-end=3D"2472">
<li data-start=3D"2180" data-end=3D"2242" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2182" data-end=3D"2242" class=3D"">Le nom d'une constante =
ne doit pas commencer par un chiffre.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2243" data-end=3D"2385" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2245" data-end=3D"2385" class=3D"">Les noms de constantes =
sont sensibles =C3=A0 la casse, mais il est d'usage de les =C3=A9crire en <=
strong data-start=3D"2332" data-end=3D"2346">majuscules</strong> par conven=
tion (ex. <code data-start=3D"2367" data-end=3D"2377">SITE_URL</code>, <cod=
e data-start=3D"2379" data-end=3D"2383">PI</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2386" data-end=3D"2472" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2388" data-end=3D"2472" class=3D"">Une constante ne peut p=
as =C3=AAtre red=C3=A9finie ou supprim=C3=A9e une fois qu=E2=80=99elle est =
d=C3=A9clar=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2474" data-end=3D"2477" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2479" data-end=3D"2539" class=3D"">II. Types de Constante=
