s. Ils sont tr=C3=A8s utiles dans tous les types de programmes.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1730" data-end=3D"1733" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"1735" data-end=3D"1805" class=3D"">II. Les Op=C3=A9rateur=
s d'Incr=C3=A9mentation et de D=C3=A9cr=C3=A9mentation (D=C3=A9butant)</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1807" data-end=3D"1945" class=3D"">Les op=C3=A9rateurs d'i=
ncr=C3=A9mentation (<code data-start=3D"1840" data-end=3D"1844">++</code>) =
et de d=C3=A9cr=C3=A9mentation (<code data-start=3D"1868" data-end=3D"1872"=
>--</code>) sont utilis=C3=A9s pour augmenter ou diminuer la valeur d'une v=
ariable de 1.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1947" data-end=3D"1977" class=3D"">2.1. Incr=C3=A9mentati=
on (<code data-start=3D"1972" data-end=3D"1976">++</code>)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1979" data-end=3D"2123" class=3D"">L'op=C3=A9rateur <code =
data-start=3D"1991" data-end=3D"1995">++</code> permet d'augmenter la valeu=
r d'une variable de 1. Il peut =C3=AAtre utilis=C3=A9 en <strong data-start=
=3D"2070" data-end=3D"2092">pr=C3=A9-incr=C3=A9mentation</strong> ou en <st=
rong data-start=3D"2099" data-end=3D"2122">post-incr=C3=A9mentation</strong=
>.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2125" data-end=3D"2298">
<li data-start=3D"2125" data-end=3D"2215" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2127" data-end=3D"2215" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
127" data-end=3D"2149">Pr=C3=A9-incr=C3=A9mentation</strong> : <code data-s=
tart=3D"2152" data-end=3D"2158">++$a</code> augmente la valeur de <code dat=
a-start=3D"2181" data-end=3D"2185">$a</code> avant d'utiliser la variable.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2216" data-end=3D"2298" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2218" data-end=3D"2298" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
218" data-end=3D"2241">Post-incr=C3=A9mentation</strong> : <code data-start=
=3D"2244" data-end=3D"2250">$a++</code> utilise la valeur de <code data-sta=
rt=3D"2272" data-end=3D"2276">$a</code> avant de l'augmenter.</p>
</li>
</ul>
