</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2521" data-end=3D"2524" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2526" data-end=3D"2571" class=3D"">III. La Structure <cod=
e data-start=3D"2547" data-end=3D"2555">elseif</code> (Interm=C3=A9diaire)<=
/h2>
<p data-start=3D"2573" data-end=3D"2846" class=3D"">La structure <code data=
-start=3D"2586" data-end=3D"2594">elseif</code> est utilis=C3=A9e lorsque v=
