<li data-start=3D"1862" data-end=3D"1953" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1864" data-end=3D"1953" class=3D"">La boucle <code data-st=
art=3D"1874" data-end=3D"1879">for</code> est souvent utilis=C3=A9e lorsqu'=
