</li>
<li data-start=3D"2014" data-end=3D"2112" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2016" data-end=3D"2112" class=3D"">La condition de la bouc=
le est =C3=A9valu=C3=A9e =C3=A0 chaque it=C3=A9ration avant d'ex=C3=A9cuter=
 le code =C3=A0 l'int=C3=A9rieur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2113" data-end=3D"2179" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2115" data-end=3D"2179" class=3D"">L'incr=C3=A9mentation m=
odifie la variable de contr=C3=B4le =C3=A0 chaque cycle.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2181" data-end=3D"2184" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2186" data-end=3D"2226" class=3D"">II. La boucle <code da=
