art=3D"3731" data-end=3D"3743">do...while</code> est similaire =C3=A0 <code=
 data-start=3D"3760" data-end=3D"3767">while</code>, mais la diff=C3=A9renc=
e est que la condition est =C3=A9valu=C3=A9e apr=C3=A8s chaque it=C3=A9rati=
