</li>
<li data-start=3D"7930" data-end=3D"8017" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7932" data-end=3D"8017" class=3D"">Utilisez <code data-sta=
rt=3D"7941" data-end=3D"7948">while</code> si vous avez une condition qui d=
oit =C3=AAtre =C3=A9valu=C3=A9e =C3=A0 chaque it=C3=A9ration.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8018" data-end=3D"8091" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8020" data-end=3D"8091" class=3D"">Utilisez <code data-sta=
rt=3D"8029" data-end=3D"8038">foreach</code> pour parcourir facilement les =
=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments d'un tableau.</p>
</li>
</ul>
