</strong> : Recherche insensible =C3=A0 la casse.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2914" data-end=3D"2999" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2916" data-end=3D"2999" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
916" data-end=3D"2923"><code data-start=3D"2918" data-end=3D"2921">m</code>=
</strong> : Multilignes. Permet de faire correspondre le d=C3=A9but ou la f=
