<hr data-start=3D"5766" data-end=3D"5769" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5771" data-end=3D"5810" class=3D"">4. M=C3=A9tacaract=C3=
=A8res et motifs sp=C3=A9ciaux</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5812" data-end=3D"5939" class=3D"">Les expressions r=C3=A9=
guli=C3=A8res en PHP utilisent des <strong data-start=3D"5860" data-end=3D"=
5878">m=C3=A9tacaract=C3=A8res</strong> pour d=C3=A9finir des motifs comple=
xes. Voici les plus courants :</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5941" data-end=3D"5979" class=3D"">4.1. Les m=C3=A9tacara=
ct=C3=A8res principaux</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5981" data-end=3D"6351">
<li data-start=3D"5981" data-end=3D"6057" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5983" data-end=3D"6057" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
983" data-end=3D"5990"><code data-start=3D"5985" data-end=3D"5988">.</code>=
</strong> : Correspond =C3=A0 n'importe quel caract=C3=A8re (sauf les sauts=
 de ligne).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6058" data-end=3D"6100" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6060" data-end=3D"6100" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
060" data-end=3D"6067"><code data-start=3D"6062" data-end=3D"6065">^</code>=
</strong> : Indique le d=C3=A9but d'une cha=C3=AEne.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6101" data-end=3D"6141" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6103" data-end=3D"6141" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
103" data-end=3D"6110"><code data-start=3D"6105" data-end=3D"6108">$</code>=
</strong> : Indique la fin d'une cha=C3=AEne.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6142" data-end=3D"6264" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6144" data-end=3D"6264" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
144" data-end=3D"6152"><code data-start=3D"6146" data-end=3D"6150">[]</code=
></strong> : Correspond =C3=A0 un caract=C3=A8re parmi ceux d=C3=A9finis en=
tre les crochets. Exemple : <code data-start=3D"6230" data-end=3D"6237">[a-=
z]</code> pour une lettre minuscule.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6265" data-end=3D"6351" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6267" data-end=3D"6351" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
267" data-end=3D"6274"><code data-start=3D"6269" data-end=3D"6272">|</code>=
</strong> : Ou logique. Correspond =C3=A0 l'une des expressions sur la gauc=
he ou la droite.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6353" data-end=3D"6383" class=3D"">4.2. Classes de caract=
=C3=A8res</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6385" data-end=3D"6471" class=3D"">Les classes de caract=
=C3=A8res d=C3=A9finissent des ensembles de caract=C3=A8res. Quelques exemp=
les :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6473" data-end=3D"6701">
<li data-start=3D"6473" data-end=3D"6533" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6475" data-end=3D"6533" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
475" data-end=3D"6483"><code data-start=3D"6477" data-end=3D"6481">\d</code=
></strong> : Correspond =C3=A0 un chiffre (=C3=A9quivalent =C3=A0 <code dat=
a-start=3D"6524" data-end=3D"6531">[0-9]</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6534" data-end=3D"6610" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6536" data-end=3D"6610" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
536" data-end=3D"6544"><code data-start=3D"6538" data-end=3D"6542">\w</code=
></strong> : Correspond =C3=A0 un caract=C3=A8re alphanum=C3=A9rique (lettr=
es et chiffres).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6611" data-end=3D"6653" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6613" data-end=3D"6653" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
613" data-end=3D"6621"><code data-start=3D"6615" data-end=3D"6619">\s</code=
></strong> : Correspond =C3=A0 un espace blanc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6654" data-end=3D"6701" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6656" data-end=3D"6701" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
656" data-end=3D"6664"><code data-start=3D"6658" data-end=3D"6662">\b</code=
></strong> : Correspond =C3=A0 une fronti=C3=A8re de mot.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6703" data-end=3D"6727" class=3D"">4.3. Quantificateurs</=
h3>
<p data-start=3D"6729" data-end=3D"6814" class=3D"">Les quantificateurs per=
mettent de sp=C3=A9cifier combien de fois un motif doit appara=C3=AEtre.</p=
>
<ul data-start=3D"6816" data-end=3D"7140">
<li data-start=3D"6816" data-end=3D"6871" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6818" data-end=3D"6871" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
818" data-end=3D"6825"><code data-start=3D"6820" data-end=3D"6823">*</code>=
</strong> : Correspond =C3=A0 z=C3=A9ro ou plusieurs occurrences.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6872" data-end=3D"6926" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6874" data-end=3D"6926" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
874" data-end=3D"6881"><code data-start=3D"6876" data-end=3D"6879">+</code>=
</strong> : Correspond =C3=A0 une ou plusieurs occurrences.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6927" data-end=3D"6975" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6929" data-end=3D"6975" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
929" data-end=3D"6936"><code data-start=3D"6931" data-end=3D"6934">?</code>=
</strong> : Correspond =C3=A0 z=C3=A9ro ou une occurrence.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6976" data-end=3D"7030" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6978" data-end=3D"7030" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
978" data-end=3D"6987"><code data-start=3D"6980" data-end=3D"6985">{n}</cod=
e></strong> : Correspond exactement =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"7014" data-e=
nd=3D"7017">n</code> occurrences.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7031" data-end=3D"7083" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7033" data-end=3D"7083" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
033" data-end=3D"7043"><code data-start=3D"7035" data-end=3D"7041">{n,}</co=
de></strong> : Correspond =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"7059" data-end=3D"7062=
">n</code> occurrences ou plus.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7084" data-end=3D"7140" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7086" data-end=3D"7140" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
086" data-end=3D"7097"><code data-start=3D"7088" data-end=3D"7095">{n,m}</c=
ode></strong> : Correspond entre <code data-start=3D"7117" data-end=3D"7120=
">n</code> et <code data-start=3D"7124" data-end=3D"7127">m</code> occurren=
ces.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"7142" data-end=3D"7173" class=3D"">4.4. Groupes et parent=
h=C3=A8ses</h3>
<p data-start=3D"7175" data-end=3D"7364" class=3D"">Les parenth=C3=A8ses so=
nt utilis=C3=A9es pour grouper des motifs et pour cr=C3=A9er des <strong da=
ta-start=3D"7248" data-end=3D"7268">capturing groups</strong> (groupes capt=
urants) qui peuvent =C3=AAtre r=C3=A9utilis=C3=A9s avec <strong data-start=
=3D"7323" data-end=3D"7342"><code data-start=3D"7325" data-end=3D"7329">\1<=
/code>, <code data-start=3D"7331" data-end=3D"7335">\2</code>, ...</strong>=
 dans le remplacement.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"7366" data-end=3D"7369" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"7371" data-end=3D"7426" class=3D"">5. Exemples d=E2=80=99=
