ys()</code></strong> : Retourne les cl=C3=A9s d'un tableau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7342" data-end=3D"7401" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7344" data-end=3D"7401" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
344" data-end=3D"7364"><code data-start=3D"7346" data-end=3D"7362">array_va=
lues()</code></strong> : Retourne les valeurs d'un tableau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7402" data-end=3D"7459" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7404" data-end=3D"7459" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
404" data-end=3D"7423"><code data-start=3D"7406" data-end=3D"7421">array_sl=
ice()</code></strong> : Extrait une portion d'un tableau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7460" data-end=3D"7528" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7462" data-end=3D"7528" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
462" data-end=3D"7480"><code data-start=3D"7464" data-end=3D"7478">array_fl=
ip()</code></strong> : Inverse les cl=C3=A9s et les valeurs d'un tableau.</=
