is la classe <code data-start=3D"3468" data-end=3D"3477">Voiture</code>.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3479" data-end=3D"3584" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3481" data-end=3D"3584" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"348=
