la classe <code data-start=3D"3554" data-end=3D"3563">Voiture</code> et ses=
 sous-classes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3586" data-end=3D"3613" class=3D"">2.2 Attributs statique=
s</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3615" data-end=3D"3869" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"3618" data-end=3D"3639">attribut statique</strong> est partag=C3=A9 ent=
