<h3 data-start=3D"4341" data-end=3D"4385" class=3D"">Configuration des erre=
urs avec <code data-start=3D"4376" data-end=3D"4385">php.ini</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4387" data-end=3D"4539" class=3D"">PHP dispose d'un fichie=
r de configuration <code data-start=3D"4429" data-end=3D"4438">php.ini</cod=
e> o=C3=B9 vous pouvez configurer le comportement des erreurs. Les directiv=
es importantes =C3=A0 conna=C3=AEtre sont :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4541" data-end=3D"4772">
<li data-start=3D"4541" data-end=3D"4618" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4543" data-end=3D"4618" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"454=
3" data-end=3D"4559">display_errors</code>: Contr=C3=B4le si les erreurs do=
ivent =C3=AAtre affich=C3=A9es =C3=A0 l'=C3=A9cran.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4619" data-end=3D"4709" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4621" data-end=3D"4709" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"462=
1" data-end=3D"4633">log_errors</code>: Contr=C3=B4le si les erreurs doiven=
t =C3=AAtre enregistr=C3=A9es dans un fichier journal.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4710" data-end=3D"4772" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4712" data-end=3D"4772" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"471=
2" data-end=3D"4729">error_reporting</code>: D=C3=A9finit le niveau des err=
eurs =C3=A0 signaler.</p>
</li>
</ul>
