<p data-start=3D"5551" data-end=3D"5801" class=3D"">La principale diff=C3=
=A9rence entre <code data-start=3D"5582" data-end=3D"5589">$_GET</code>, <c=
ode data-start=3D"5591" data-end=3D"5599">$_POST</code>, et <code data-star=
t=3D"5604" data-end=3D"5615">$_REQUEST</code> est que <code data-start=3D"5=
624" data-end=3D"5635">$_REQUEST</code> peut contenir des donn=C3=A9es prov=
enant de toutes les m=C3=A9thodes, ce qui peut =C3=AAtre pratique, mais aus=
si risqu=C3=A9 si l=E2=80=99on ne sait pas exactement d=E2=80=99o=C3=B9 pro=
viennent les donn=C3=A9es.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5803" data-end=3D"5806" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5808" data-end=3D"5864" class=3D"">5. Diff=C3=A9rences en=
