=C3=A9es combin=C3=A9es</td><td>D=C3=A9pend de la source</td><td>D=C3=A9pen=
d de la source</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<ul data-start=3D"6364" data-end=3D"6738">
<li data-start=3D"6364" data-end=3D"6466" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6366" data-end=3D"6466" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
366" data-end=3D"6377"><code data-start=3D"6368" data-end=3D"6375">$_GET</c=
ode></strong> est limit=C3=A9 en taille et visible dans l'URL, ce qui peut =
poser des probl=C3=A8mes de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6467" data-end=3D"6594" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6469" data-end=3D"6594" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
469" data-end=3D"6481"><code data-start=3D"6471" data-end=3D"6479">$_POST</=
