<h3 data-start=3D"7446" data-end=3D"7478" class=3D"">Pr=C3=A9vention des at=
taques CSRF</h3>
<p data-start=3D"7480" data-end=3D"7748" class=3D"">La meilleure fa=C3=A7on=
