<li data-start=3D"3637" data-end=3D"3715" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3639" data-end=3D"3715" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
639" data-end=3D"3649"><code data-start=3D"3641" data-end=3D"3647">name</co=
de></strong> : Le nom du fichier tel qu'il a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 t=C3=A9l=C3=A9ch=
arg=C3=A9 par l'utilisateur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3716" data-end=3D"3800" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3718" data-end=3D"3800" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
718" data-end=3D"3728"><code data-start=3D"3720" data-end=3D"3726">type</co=
de></strong> : Le type MIME du fichier. Par exemple, "image/png", "text/pla=
in", etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3801" data-end=3D"3902" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3803" data-end=3D"3902" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
803" data-end=3D"3817"><code data-start=3D"3805" data-end=3D"3815">tmp_name=
</code></strong> : Le chemin temporaire o=C3=B9 le fichier est stock=C3=A9 =
sur le serveur avant d'=C3=AAtre d=C3=A9plac=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3903" data-end=3D"4037" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3905" data-end=3D"4037" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
905" data-end=3D"3916"><code data-start=3D"3907" data-end=3D"3914">error</c=
ode></strong> : Le code d'erreur associ=C3=A9 au t=C3=A9l=C3=A9chargement d=
u fichier. Si aucune erreur n'est survenue, cette valeur sera =C3=A9gale =
=C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"4033" data-end=3D"4036">0</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4038" data-end=3D"4084" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4040" data-end=3D"4084" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
040" data-end=3D"4050"><code data-start=3D"4042" data-end=3D"4048">size</co=
de></strong> : La taille du fichier en octets.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4086" data-end=3D"4089" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4091" data-end=3D"4132" class=3D"">4. Traitement des fich=
iers t=C3=A9l=C3=A9charg=C3=A9s</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4134" data-end=3D"4161" class=3D"">Validation des fichier=
s</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4163" data-end=3D"4351" class=3D"">Avant de traiter le fic=
