<h3 data-start=3D"5724" data-end=3D"5765" class=3D"">Gestion des erreurs de=
 t=C3=A9l=C3=A9chargement</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5767" data-end=3D"5973" class=3D"">La superglobale <code d=
ata-start=3D"5783" data-end=3D"5792">$_FILES</code> contient =C3=A9galement=
 un code d'erreur qui permet de savoir si une erreur est survenue pendant l=
e t=C3=A9l=C3=A9chargement. Voici les diff=C3=A9rents codes d'erreur possib=
les et leur signification :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5975" data-end=3D"6673">
<li data-start=3D"5975" data-end=3D"6058" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5977" data-end=3D"6058" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
977" data-end=3D"5996"><code data-start=3D"5979" data-end=3D"5994">UPLOAD_E=
RR_OK</code></strong> (0) : Aucune erreur, le fichier a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 t=C3=
=A9l=C3=A9charg=C3=A9 avec succ=C3=A8s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6059" data-end=3D"6171" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6061" data-end=3D"6171" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
061" data-end=3D"6086"><code data-start=3D"6063" data-end=3D"6084">UPLOAD_E=
RR_INI_SIZE</code></strong> (1) : Le fichier d=C3=A9passe la directive <cod=
e data-start=3D"6125" data-end=3D"6146">upload_max_filesize</code> dans le =
fichier php.ini.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6172" data-end=3D"6287" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6174" data-end=3D"6287" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
174" data-end=3D"6200"><code data-start=3D"6176" data-end=3D"6198">UPLOAD_E=
RR_FORM_SIZE</code></strong> (2) : Le fichier d=C3=A9passe la directive <co=
de data-start=3D"6239" data-end=3D"6254">MAX_FILE_SIZE</code> d=C3=A9finie =
dans le formulaire HTML.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6288" data-end=3D"6369" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6290" data-end=3D"6369" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
290" data-end=3D"6314"><code data-start=3D"6292" data-end=3D"6312">UPLOAD_E=
RR_PARTIAL</code></strong> (3) : Le fichier n'a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 que partielle=
ment t=C3=A9l=C3=A9charg=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6370" data-end=3D"6436" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6372" data-end=3D"6436" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
372" data-end=3D"6396"><code data-start=3D"6374" data-end=3D"6394">UPLOAD_E=
RR_NO_FILE</code></strong> (4) : Aucun fichier n'a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 t=C3=A9l=
=C3=A9charg=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6437" data-end=3D"6505" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6439" data-end=3D"6505" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
439" data-end=3D"6466"><code data-start=3D"6441" data-end=3D"6464">UPLOAD_E=
RR_NO_TMP_DIR</code></strong> (6) : Le r=C3=A9pertoire temporaire manque.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6506" data-end=3D"6587" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6508" data-end=3D"6587" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
508" data-end=3D"6535"><code data-start=3D"6510" data-end=3D"6533">UPLOAD_E=
RR_CANT_WRITE</code></strong> (7) : Impossible d'=C3=A9crire le fichier sur=
 le disque.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6588" data-end=3D"6673" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6590" data-end=3D"6673" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
590" data-end=3D"6616"><code data-start=3D"6592" data-end=3D"6614">UPLOAD_E=
RR_EXTENSION</code></strong> (8) : Une extension PHP a interrompu l'envoi d=
u fichier.</p>
</li>
</ul>
