<hr data-start=3D"5235" data-end=3D"5238" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5240" data-end=3D"5282" class=3D"">3. V=C3=A9rification d=
e la taille du fichier</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5284" data-end=3D"5573" class=3D"">V=C3=A9rifier la taille=
