<h3 data-start=3D"5958" data-end=3D"5986" class=3D"">Limites impos=C3=A9es =
par PHP</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5988" data-end=3D"6168" class=3D"">En plus de votre valida=
tion, PHP a des limites par d=C3=A9faut qui peuvent restreindre la taille m=
aximale des fichiers t=C3=A9l=C3=A9charg=C3=A9s. Ces limites sont d=C3=A9fi=
nies dans le fichier <code data-start=3D"6157" data-end=3D"6166">php.ini</c=
ode> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6170" data-end=3D"6330">
<li data-start=3D"6170" data-end=3D"6243" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6172" data-end=3D"6243" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
172" data-end=3D"6197"><code data-start=3D"6174" data-end=3D"6195">upload_m=
ax_filesize</code></strong> : La taille maximale d'un fichier t=C3=A9l=C3=
=A9charg=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6244" data-end=3D"6330" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6246" data-end=3D"6330" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
246" data-end=3D"6265"><code data-start=3D"6248" data-end=3D"6263">post_max=
_size</code></strong> : La taille maximale des donn=C3=A9es envoy=C3=A9es d=
ans une requ=C3=AAte POST.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6332" data-end=3D"6465" class=3D"">Veillez =C3=A0 ajuster =
ces valeurs en fonction des besoins de votre application, et =C3=A0 les val=
ider dans votre code pour =C3=A9viter des erreurs.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6467" data-end=3D"6470" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6472" data-end=3D"6514" class=3D"">4. Gestion des erreurs=
 lors de l'upload</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6516" data-end=3D"6688" class=3D"">PHP propose une gestion=
 des erreurs lors des t=C3=A9l=C3=A9chargements via le tableau <code data-s=
tart=3D"6592" data-end=3D"6618">$_FILES['file']['error']</code>. Voici un a=
per=C3=A7u des codes d'erreur possibles et leur signification :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6690" data-end=3D"7420">
<li data-start=3D"6690" data-end=3D"6773" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6692" data-end=3D"6773" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
692" data-end=3D"6715"><code data-start=3D"6694" data-end=3D"6709">UPLOAD_E=
RR_OK</code> (0)</strong> : Pas d'erreur, le fichier a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 t=C3=
=A9l=C3=A9charg=C3=A9 correctement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6774" data-end=3D"6895" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6776" data-end=3D"6895" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
776" data-end=3D"6805"><code data-start=3D"6778" data-end=3D"6799">UPLOAD_E=
RR_INI_SIZE</code> (1)</strong> : Le fichier d=C3=A9passe la taille maximal=
e autoris=C3=A9e dans <code data-start=3D"6861" data-end=3D"6870">php.ini</=
code> (<code data-start=3D"6872" data-end=3D"6893">upload_max_filesize</cod=
e>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6896" data-end=3D"7021" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6898" data-end=3D"7021" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
898" data-end=3D"6928"><code data-start=3D"6900" data-end=3D"6922">UPLOAD_E=
RR_FORM_SIZE</code> (2)</strong> : Le fichier d=C3=A9passe la taille maxima=
le autoris=C3=A9e dans le formulaire HTML (<code data-start=3D"7004" data-e=
nd=3D"7019">MAX_FILE_SIZE</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7022" data-end=3D"7097" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7024" data-end=3D"7097" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
024" data-end=3D"7052"><code data-start=3D"7026" data-end=3D"7046">UPLOAD_E=
RR_PARTIAL</code> (3)</strong> : Le fichier a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 partiellement t=
=C3=A9l=C3=A9charg=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7098" data-end=3D"7164" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7100" data-end=3D"7164" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
100" data-end=3D"7128"><code data-start=3D"7102" data-end=3D"7122">UPLOAD_E=
RR_NO_FILE</code> (4)</strong> : Aucun fichier n'a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 t=C3=A9l=
=C3=A9charg=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7165" data-end=3D"7253" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7167" data-end=3D"7253" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
167" data-end=3D"7198"><code data-start=3D"7169" data-end=3D"7192">UPLOAD_E=
RR_NO_TMP_DIR</code> (6)</strong> : Le r=C3=A9pertoire temporaire manque ou=
 est inaccessible.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7254" data-end=3D"7335" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7256" data-end=3D"7335" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
256" data-end=3D"7287"><code data-start=3D"7258" data-end=3D"7281">UPLOAD_E=
RR_CANT_WRITE</code> (7)</strong> : Impossible d'=C3=A9crire le fichier sur=
 le disque.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7336" data-end=3D"7420" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7338" data-end=3D"7420" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
338" data-end=3D"7368"><code data-start=3D"7340" data-end=3D"7362">UPLOAD_E=
RR_EXTENSION</code> (8)</strong> : Une extension PHP a interrompu le t=C3=
=A9l=C3=A9chargement.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"7422" data-end=3D"7463" class=3D"">Voici un exemple de ges=
tion des erreurs :</p>
