<p data-start=3D"3141" data-end=3D"3313" class=3D"">L'argument <code data-s=
tart=3D"3152" data-end=3D"3158">true</code> pass=C3=A9 =C3=A0 <code data-st=
art=3D"3167" data-end=3D"3192">session_regenerate_id()</code> permet de sup=
primer l'ancien ID de session et de cr=C3=A9er un nouveau, rendant ainsi l'=
ID de session pr=C3=A9c=C3=A9dent inutilisable.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3315" data-end=3D"3341" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
315" data-end=3D"3341">Quand r=C3=A9g=C3=A9n=C3=A9rer l'ID ?</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3342" data-end=3D"3584">
<li data-start=3D"3342" data-end=3D"3437" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3344" data-end=3D"3437" class=3D"">Lors de la connexion de=
 l'utilisateur (apr=C3=A8s avoir valid=C3=A9 ses informations d'identificat=
ion).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3438" data-end=3D"3538" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3440" data-end=3D"3538" class=3D"">Lorsque l'utilisateur c=
hange des informations sensibles, telles que son mot de passe ou son email.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3539" data-end=3D"3584" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3541" data-end=3D"3584" class=3D"">=C3=80 intervalles r=C3=
=A9guliers pendant la session.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3586" data-end=3D"3589" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"3591" data-end=3D"3631" class=3D"">2.2 Utilisation de Coo=
kies S=C3=A9curis=C3=A9s</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3633" data-end=3D"3848" class=3D"">Par d=C3=A9faut, PHP st=
ocke l'ID de session dans un cookie appel=C3=A9 <code data-start=3D"3694" d=
ata-end=3D"3705">PHPSESSID</code>. Ce cookie peut =C3=AAtre intercept=C3=A9=
 si l'application n'est pas correctement s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9e, ce qui peut c=
onduire =C3=A0 un <strong data-start=3D"3815" data-end=3D"3847">vol d'ident=
ifiant de session</strong>.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3850" data-end=3D"3874" class=3D"">Mesures =C3=A0 prendre=
 :</h4>
<ol data-start=3D"3875" data-end=3D"4150">
<li data-start=3D"3875" data-end=3D"4150" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3878" data-end=3D"3912" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
878" data-end=3D"3909">Utiliser le cookie s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3916" data-end=3D"4150">
<li data-start=3D"3916" data-end=3D"4008" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3918" data-end=3D"4008" class=3D"">Le cookie ne doit =C3=
=AAtre accessible qu'en HTTPS pour =C3=A9viter qu'il ne soit transmis en cl=
air.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4012" data-end=3D"4150" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4014" data-end=3D"4150" class=3D"">Le cookie ne doit =C3=
=AAtre accessible par JavaScript pour =C3=A9viter qu'il ne soit vol=C3=A9 p=
ar des attaques de type <strong data-start=3D"4119" data-end=3D"4149">XSS (=
Cross-Site Scripting)</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
