<hr data-start=3D"8313" data-end=3D"8316" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8318" data-end=3D"8352" class=3D"">6. Limiter l=E2=80=99A=
cc=C3=A8s aux Sessions</h2>
<p data-start=3D"8354" data-end=3D"8444" class=3D"">L'acc=C3=A8s aux sessio=
ns doit =C3=AAtre limit=C3=A9 =C3=A0 l'utilisateur qui les a cr=C3=A9=C3=A9=
es. Assurez-vous que :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"8446" data-end=3D"8696">
<li data-start=3D"8446" data-end=3D"8525" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8449" data-end=3D"8525" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
449" data-end=3D"8524">Seul l'utilisateur authentifi=C3=A9 a acc=C3=A8s =C3=
=A0 ses propres donn=C3=A9es de session</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8526" data-end=3D"8696" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8529" data-end=3D"8696" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
529" data-end=3D"8609">Prot=C3=A9gez les sessions contre les attaques de ty=
pe Cross-Site Scripting (XSS)</strong>, qui peuvent permettre =C3=A0 un att=
aquant d'acc=C3=A9der aux donn=C3=A9es de session via JavaScript.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"8698" data-end=3D"8701" class=3D"">
