<h2 data-start=3D"4818" data-end=3D"4863" class=3D"">4. Modification et Sup=
pression des Cookies</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4865" data-end=3D"4896" class=3D"">Modifier un cookie exi=
stant</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4898" data-end=3D"5088" class=3D"">Pour modifier un cookie=
