<hr data-start=3D"1465" data-end=3D"1468" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"1470" data-end=3D"1494" class=3D"">1. Introduction =C3=A0=
 PDO</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1496" data-end=3D"1812" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"1499" data-end=3D"1525">PDO (PHP Data Objects)</strong> est une extensi=
on qui fournit une interface uniforme pour acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 diff=C3=A9re=
ntes bases de donn=C3=A9es. L=E2=80=99objectif principal de PDO est d=E2=80=
=99abstraire les sp=C3=A9cificit=C3=A9s de chaque moteur de base de donn=C3=
=A9es, offrant ainsi une mani=C3=A8re coh=C3=A9rente d=E2=80=99interagir av=
ec diff=C3=A9rents types de bases de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1814" data-end=3D"2056" class=3D"">En utilisant PDO, vous =
pouvez facilement changer de SGBD sans avoir =C3=A0 r=C3=A9=C3=A9crire tout=
 votre code. De plus, PDO prend en charge les requ=C3=AAtes pr=C3=A9par=C3=
=A9es, ce qui renforce la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 de vos applications en vous pr=
ot=C3=A9geant contre les injections SQL.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2058" data-end=3D"2061" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2063" data-end=3D"2085" class=3D"">2. Avantages de PDO</h=
2>
<ul data-start=3D"2087" data-end=3D"2629">
<li data-start=3D"2087" data-end=3D"2180" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2089" data-end=3D"2180" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
089" data-end=3D"2118">Support de multiples SGBD</strong> : PDO supporte My=
SQL, PostgreSQL, SQLite, Oracle, MSSQL, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2181" data-end=3D"2289" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2183" data-end=3D"2289" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
183" data-end=3D"2205">Requ=C3=AAtes pr=C3=A9par=C3=A9es</strong> : Gr=C3=
=A2ce aux requ=C3=AAtes pr=C3=A9par=C3=A9es, PDO offre une protection contr=
e les injections SQL.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2290" data-end=3D"2445" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2292" data-end=3D"2445" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
292" data-end=3D"2320">Interface orient=C3=A9e objet</strong> : La syntaxe =
PDO est orient=C3=A9e objet, ce qui permet de b=C3=A9n=C3=A9ficier de la fl=
exibilit=C3=A9 de la programmation orient=C3=A9e objet (POO).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2446" data-end=3D"2533" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2448" data-end=3D"2533" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
448" data-end=3D"2471">Gestion des erreurs</strong> : PDO permet une gestio=
n fine des erreurs via des exceptions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2534" data-end=3D"2629" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2536" data-end=3D"2629" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
536" data-end=3D"2552">Transactions</strong> : Vous pouvez g=C3=A9rer les t=
ransactions de mani=C3=A8re fluide et efficace avec PDO.</p>
</li>
</ul>
