<ul data-start=3D"3735" data-end=3D"3975">
<li data-start=3D"3735" data-end=3D"3800" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3737" data-end=3D"3800" class=3D"">Non fatales : elles n'e=
mp=C3=AAchent pas le programme de s'ex=C3=A9cuter.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3801" data-end=3D"3920" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3803" data-end=3D"3920" class=3D"">Signale une utilisation=
 incorrecte du code (comme des variables non initialis=C3=A9es ou des erreu=
rs de syntaxe mineures).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3921" data-end=3D"3975" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3923" data-end=3D"3975" class=3D"">Plus fr=C3=A9quentes da=
ns un code non strictement valid=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3977" data-end=3D"4015" class=3D"">2.3 Fatal Errors (Erre=
urs Fatales)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4017" data-end=3D"4327" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"4021" data-end=3D"4037">Fatal Errors</strong> sont des erreurs graves q=
