fonction non d=C3=A9finie. Le message d'erreur est accompagn=C3=A9 d'une <s=
trong data-start=3D"4603" data-end=3D"4618">stack trace</strong> pour aider=
 au d=C3=A9bogage.</p>
<p data-start=3D"4644" data-end=3D"4683" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
644" data-end=3D"4683">Caract=C3=A9ristiques des Fatal Errors :</strong></p=
>
<ul data-start=3D"4684" data-end=3D"4919">
<li data-start=3D"4684" data-end=3D"4749" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4686" data-end=3D"4749" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
686" data-end=3D"4697">Fatales</strong> : emp=C3=AAchent le programme de co=
ntinuer =C3=A0 s'ex=C3=A9cuter.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4750" data-end=3D"4919" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4752" data-end=3D"4919" class=3D"">Souvent li=C3=A9es =C3=
=A0 des erreurs graves, telles que l=E2=80=99appel d=E2=80=99une fonction o=
u d=E2=80=99une m=C3=A9thode inexistante, des probl=C3=A8mes de syntaxe irr=
=C3=A9parables ou des erreurs de ressources.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4921" data-end=3D"4924" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4926" data-end=3D"4951" class=3D"">3. Gestion des Erreurs=
</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4953" data-end=3D"5006" class=3D"">3.1 Activer et D=C3=A9=
