<p data-start=3D"2863" data-end=3D"2881" class=3D"">Dans cet exemple :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2882" data-end=3D"3114">
<li data-start=3D"2882" data-end=3D"2962" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2884" data-end=3D"2962" class=3D"">La fonction <code data-=
start=3D"2896" data-end=3D"2908">division()</code> g=C3=A9n=C3=A8re une exc=
eption si le d=C3=A9nominateur est =C3=A9gal =C3=A0 0.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2963" data-end=3D"3008" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2965" data-end=3D"3008" class=3D"">Le bloc <code data-star=
t=3D"2973" data-end=3D"2978">try</code> tente d'ex=C3=A9cuter la division.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3009" data-end=3D"3114" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3011" data-end=3D"3114" class=3D"">Si une exception est la=
nc=C3=A9e, elle est captur=C3=A9e par le bloc <code data-start=3D"3070" dat=
a-end=3D"3077">catch</code>, et le message d'erreur est affich=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3116" data-end=3D"3119" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3121" data-end=3D"3144" class=3D"">3. Le Bloc <code data-=
start=3D"3135" data-end=3D"3144">finally</code></h2>
<p data-start=3D"3146" data-end=3D"3430" class=3D"">Le bloc <code data-star=
t=3D"3154" data-end=3D"3163">finally</code> est ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9 apr=C3=A8=
s les blocs <code data-start=3D"3192" data-end=3D"3197">try</code> et <code=
 data-start=3D"3201" data-end=3D"3208">catch</code>, qu'une exception ait =
=C3=A9t=C3=A9 lanc=C3=A9e ou non. C'est un endroit id=C3=A9al pour mettre d=
u code qui doit toujours =C3=AAtre ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9, comme la fermeture de=
 connexions ou le nettoyage des ressources, ind=C3=A9pendamment de l'issue =
du bloc <code data-start=3D"3424" data-end=3D"3429">try</code>.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3432" data-end=3D"3472" class=3D"">Caract=C3=A9ristiques =
du bloc <code data-start=3D"3461" data-end=3D"3470">finally</code> :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3473" data-end=3D"3729">
<li data-start=3D"3473" data-end=3D"3526" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3475" data-end=3D"3526" class=3D"">Il est ex=C3=A9cut=C3=
=A9 qu'une exception soit lanc=C3=A9e ou non.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3527" data-end=3D"3627" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3529" data-end=3D"3627" class=3D"">Il est toujours ex=C3=
=A9cut=C3=A9 apr=C3=A8s le bloc <code data-start=3D"3567" data-end=3D"3572"=
>try</code> et apr=C3=A8s le bloc <code data-start=3D"3590" data-end=3D"359=
7">catch</code> si une exception a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 lev=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3628" data-end=3D"3729" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3630" data-end=3D"3729" class=3D"">M=C3=AAme si une except=
ion est lanc=C3=A9e ou captur=C3=A9e, le code dans le bloc <code data-start=
=3D"3697" data-end=3D"3706">finally</code> sera toujours ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9.=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
