<h3 data-start=3D"4382" data-end=3D"4432" class=3D"">4.1 R=C3=A9cup=C3=A9re=
r des Informations sur l'Exception</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4434" data-end=3D"4548" class=3D"">Lorsqu'une exception es=
t lanc=C3=A9e, vous pouvez r=C3=A9cup=C3=A9rer plusieurs informations =C3=
=A0 son sujet via des m=C3=A9thodes comme :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4549" data-end=3D"4817">
<li data-start=3D"4549" data-end=3D"4594" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4551" data-end=3D"4594" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"455=
1" data-end=3D"4565">getMessage()</code> : le message de l'exception.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4595" data-end=3D"4643" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4597" data-end=3D"4643" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"459=
7" data-end=3D"4608">getCode()</code> : le code d'erreur de l'exception.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4644" data-end=3D"4698" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4646" data-end=3D"4698" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"464=
6" data-end=3D"4657">getFile()</code> : le fichier o=C3=B9 l'exception a =
=C3=A9t=C3=A9 lev=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4699" data-end=3D"4762" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4701" data-end=3D"4762" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"470=
1" data-end=3D"4712">getLine()</code> : la ligne du fichier o=C3=B9 l'excep=
tion a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 lev=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4763" data-end=3D"4817" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4765" data-end=3D"4817" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"476=
5" data-end=3D"4785">getTraceAsString()</code> : la trace de la pile d'appe=
ls.</p>
</li>
</ul>
