ata-end=3D"7160">throw</code> en PHP :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"7171" data-end=3D"7844">
<li data-start=3D"7171" data-end=3D"7419" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7174" data-end=3D"7419" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
174" data-end=3D"7227">Utiliser <code data-start=3D"7185" data-end=3D"7192"=
>throw</code> pour des erreurs exceptionnelles</strong> : Ne lancez des exc=
